dist/extension.js
-----------------
Bundles vscode-languageclient and its dependencies (MIT, ISC, BlueOak-1.0.0). The build writes each
bundled package's name, version and licence text to dist/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt.

dist/webview/graph.js
---------------------
Bundles Cytoscape.js (MIT) and dagre with graphlib (@dagrejs/dagre, @dagrejs/graphlib; MIT) for the
graph panel. Their versions and licence texts are in dist/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt too. Cytoscape.js
inlines code under MIT notices of its own (Ralf S. Engelschall's Promises/A+ Thenable, an event object
based on jQuery's, Gaetan Renaudeau's bezier curve generator and Koen Bok's Framer.js spring); the build
keeps every such notice, gathered at the end of each bundle.
